  "answer": "**答案:South Orange Little League(奥兰多西南部)。**\n\n他小时候在这个联盟打球,之后在 Walker Jr. High 打球,再上 Dr. Phillips High School。\n\n依据:\n- https://www.mlive.com/tigers/2010/04/now_with_tigers_veteran_big_le.html:Damon 说,母亲让他和哥哥 James 报名了奥兰多西南部的 South Orange Little League,他的第一支队伍是 T-ball 的 Green Machine。\n- https://ocps.ss15.sharpschool.com/cms/One.aspx?portalId=54703&pageId=89584:他在 South Orange Little League 打球。\n- https://www.memorabilix.co.uk/baseball-11/johnny-damon-13964/:他小时候在 South Orange Little League 打球,之后在 Walker Jr. High 打球,再上高中。\n\n我只搜了 1 次。",
